    <title>Cat FAQ - Modern Feline Knowledge</title>
    <style>
:root {
    --primary-color: #2563eb;
    --text-color: #1f2937;
    --bg-color: #f9fafb;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --border-color: #e5e7eb;
    --hover-bg: #f3f4f6;
    --font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
}

body {
    font-family: var(--font-family);
